# Ops References

Resolve paths from this repository's `codex/` root unless explicitly overridden by a file.

## Always Read

- `docs/workflows/pcg-blueprint-authoring.md`
- `docs/workflows/unreal-asset-authoring.md`

## Read When Relevant

- `docs/projects/cubeless-stylized/systems/pcg-dungeon/pcg-dungeon-review-checklist.md` for PCG Dungeon delivery review.
- `docs/projects/cubeless-stylized/systems/pcg-dungeon/pcg-dungeon-operator-guide.md` for PCG Dungeon operator-facing behavior.
- `docs/projects/cubeless-stylized/systems/pcg-dungeon/pcg-dungeon-v2-prototype.md` for V2 controller, preset, and runner behavior.
- `docs/projects/cubeless-stylized/learning/pcg/pcgstudy-source-independent-authoring.md` for source-independent PCG authoring lessons.
- `docs/projects/cubeless-stylized/learning/pcg/pcg-cpp-improvement-backlog.md` for historical C++ and tooling improvement notes.

## Verification Tools

Use project-local tools from the active Unreal project when present. In this repository, common checks include `Tools/Unreal/check_pcg_dungeon_delivery_preflight.py`, `Tools/Unreal/audit_pcg_dungeon_asset_manifest.py`, and targeted runner scripts under `Tools/Unreal/`.
